@startuml
' Level 3 - one AML alert on AWS (slice 3, v1 human-only): code alerts, a model recommends, code
' checks, a person decides. Render: plantuml-new -tpng 06-aml-triage.puml
'   1   open (admin or proof; a bank: the rules batch): seeded bank -> rules -> case snapshot.
'   2   ~300 PutItem rows into partition CASE#<alert_id> of the data table. The aml role may write
'       only CASE#A-* partitions and only the listed attributes (LeadingKeys + Attributes conditions).
'   3   StartExecution with {alert_id} only: no case data in the workflow input.
'   4-5 Review: the aml-review role has no table rights. It assumes the case-reader role. That role's
'       own policy allows GetItem and Query only when LeadingKeys matches CASE#A-* (no Scan, no writes).
'       The session policy still pins LeadingKeys to CASE#<alert_id>. Another case, a customer
'       partition, a Scan or a write is AccessDenied. Dropping the session policy still cannot read
'       a customer row. Memos arrive renamed memo_untrusted.
'   6   One gpt-oss Converse call over the whole bounded snapshot (the eval winner).
'   7   Check (plain code): reads the case again itself; cited ids must be in the case, cited KYC
'       fields non-empty, a flagged instruction memo blocks close. Any failure -> escalate.
'   8   Record: RECOMMENDATION row, analyst_queue = "aml", status awaiting_analyst. The end.
'   Planned (dashed gray): an analyst screen for the AML queue. Nothing closes an alert today.
hide footbox
skinparam ArrowColor #545B64
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C9CED6
autonumber

participant "Admin / proof" as P
participant "aml Lambda\n(rules, check, record)" as W
participant "DynamoDB\nCASE#<alert_id>" as D
participant "Step Functions" as S
participant "aml-review Lambda" as R
participant "Bedrock\ngpt-oss-120b" as M
participant "Analyst\nplanned" as A #EEEEEE

P -> W : open(alert_id)
W -> D : Put case rows
W -> S : StartExecution
S -> R : Review
R -> D : Query own case\n(case-reader, CASE#A-*)
R -> M : one Converse call
S -> W : Check (code)
W -> D : Put RECOMMENDATION (queue)
autonumber stop
A -[#999999]-> D : <color:#777777>planned: read queue, decide</color>
@enduml
